@RiverLine.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5132

### Register a cargo owner
POST {{RiverLine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "role": 0
}

### Register a carrier
POST {{RiverLine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bob",
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "role": 1,
  "companyName": "River Freight Co."
}

### Login
POST {{RiverLine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### Who am I
GET {{RiverLine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Create a shipment request (CargoOwner)
POST {{RiverLine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/shipment-requests
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
  "cargoType": "Grains",
  "weight": 1200.5,
  "origin": "Rotterdam",
  "destination": "Duisburg",
  "requestedDate": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Open shipment requests (Carrier)
GET {{RiverLine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/shipment-requests/open
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>